---
layout: base.njk
title: "Download the WebAssembly Demos"
---
<h1>Download the WebAssembly Demos</h1>
<p>Each build bundles <code>src/runtime_webgl.c</code> with the demo source.</p>
<ul>
  {% for demo in demos %}
    <li>
      <strong>{{ demo.title }}</strong>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/demos/{{ demo.id }}/{{ demo.id }}.js" download>{{ demo.id }}.js</a></li>
        <li><a href="/demos/{{ demo.id }}/{{ demo.id }}.wasm" download>{{ demo.id }}.wasm</a></li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
